# jt-filework — English catalogue (fallback locale)
#
# Format: `key = value`, one message per line. `#` starts a comment.
# `{name}` is a placeholder and is part of the message contract: the same
# placeholders must appear in every locale (docs/I18N_THEME.md 4).
#
# Keys are stable semantic identifiers, never English text. English is the
# fallback locale, so a key missing here is an error, not a gap.


